BEGIN

1. Create a graph using an adjacency list.

2. Define BFS(START).

3. Initialize VISITED with START.

4. Initialize QUEUE with START.

5. WHILE QUEUE is not empty, DO

      a. Remove the first node from QUEUE.

      b. Print the node.

      c. FOR each NEIGHBOUR of the node, DO

            IF NEIGHBOUR is not in VISITED, THEN

                i. Add NEIGHBOUR to VISITED.

                ii. Add NEIGHBOUR to QUEUE.

            END IF

         END FOR

   END WHILE

6. Call BFS(0).

END
